{
  "id": "guardianship",
  "title": {
    "en": "Guardianship",
    "ml": "രക്ഷാകർതൃത്വം"
  },
  "chapter": "dependents",
  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "guardianship.gate",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "single",
      "text": {
        "en": "Is anyone dependent on your care?",
        "ml": "ആരെങ്കിലും നിങ്ങളെ ആശ്രയിച്ചാണോ ജീവിക്കുന്നത്?"
      },
      "gate": true,
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "minors",
          "label": {
            "en": "Yes — my minor children",
            "ml": "അതെ — എന്റെ പ്രായപൂർത്തിയാകാത്ത മക്കൾ"
          },
          "next": "guardianship.primary"
        },
        {
          "id": "dependent_adult",
          "label": {
            "en": "Yes — a dependent adult",
            "ml": "അതെ — ആശ്രിതനായ ഒരു മുതിർന്ന വ്യക്തി"
          },
          "next": "guardianship.dependents.item.person"
        },
        {
          "id": "both",
          "label": {
            "en": "Yes — both",
            "ml": "അതെ — രണ്ടും"
          },
          "next": "guardianship.primary"
        },
        {
          "id": "no",
          "label": {
            "en": "No",
            "ml": "ഇല്ല"
          }
        }
      ],
      "next": "debts.gate"
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.primary",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "person",
      "text": {
        "en": "Who should raise your children if neither parent can?",
        "ml": "മാതാപിതാക്കൾക്ക് കഴിയാതെ വന്നാൽ, മക്കളെ ആര് വളർത്തണം?"
      },
      "next": "guardianship.alternate",
      "askAddress": true
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.alternate",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "person",
      "text": {
        "en": "And if they can't?",
        "ml": "അവർക്കും കഴിയില്ലെങ്കിലോ?"
      },
      "next": "guardianship.property_guardian",
      "askAddress": true
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.property_guardian",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "single",
      "text": {
        "en": "Who should manage the money and property your children inherit until they come of age?",
        "ml": "മക്കൾക്ക് പ്രായപൂർത്തിയാകുന്നതുവരെ അവർക്ക് ലഭിക്കുന്ന പണവും സ്വത്തും ആര് കൈകാര്യം ചെയ്യണം?"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "This can be the same guardian, or a different person — separating care from money is a common safeguard.",
        "ml": "ഇത് അതേ രക്ഷിതാവ് തന്നെയോ വേറൊരാളോ ആകാം — സംരക്ഷണവും പണവും വേർതിരിക്കുന്നത് ഒരു സാധാരണ മുൻകരുതലാണ്."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "same",
          "label": {
            "en": "The same guardian",
            "ml": "അതേ രക്ഷിതാവ്"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "different",
          "label": {
            "en": "A different person",
            "ml": "വേറൊരാൾ"
          },
          "next": "guardianship.property_guardian.person"
        }
      ],
      "next": "guardianship.until_age"
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.property_guardian.person",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "person",
      "text": {
        "en": "Who should manage it?",
        "ml": "ആര് കൈകാര്യം ചെയ്യണം?"
      },
      "next": "guardianship.until_age"
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.until_age",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "single",
      "text": {
        "en": "They should receive their inheritance outright at age:",
        "ml": "ഏത് പ്രായത്തിൽ അവർക്ക് പൂർണ്ണമായി അനന്തരാവകാശം ലഭിക്കണം:"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "Until then, the property guardian holds and applies it for their benefit.",
        "ml": "അതുവരെ, സ്വത്ത് സംരക്ഷകൻ അത് അവരുടെ പ്രയോജനത്തിനായി കൈകാര്യം ചെയ്യും."
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "18",
          "label": {
            "en": "18",
            "ml": "18"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "21",
          "label": {
            "en": "21",
            "ml": "21"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "25",
          "label": {
            "en": "25",
            "ml": "25"
          }
        }
      ],
      "next": "guardianship.upbringing"
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.upbringing",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "longtext",
      "text": {
        "en": "Any wishes about their upbringing?",
        "ml": "അവരുടെ വളർത്തലിനെക്കുറിച്ച് എന്തെങ്കിലും ആഗ്രഹങ്ങളുണ്ടോ?"
      },
      "optional": true,
      "next": "guardianship.provision"
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.provision",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "single",
      "text": {
        "en": "Set aside money specifically for their care?",
        "ml": "അവരുടെ സംരക്ഷണത്തിനായി പ്രത്യേകം പണം മാറ്റിവെക്കണോ?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "amount",
          "label": {
            "en": "Yes, an amount",
            "ml": "അതെ, ഒരു തുക"
          },
          "next": "guardianship.provision_amount"
        },
        {
          "id": "general_estate",
          "label": {
            "en": "My general estate will cover it",
            "ml": "എന്റെ പൊതു ആസ്തി അത് നികത്തും"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "no",
          "label": {
            "en": "No",
            "ml": "ഇല്ല"
          }
        }
      ],
      "nextRules": "[{\"when\":{\"eq\":[\"guardianship.gate\",\"both\"]},\"goto\":\"guardianship.dependents.item.person\"}]",
      "next": "debts.gate"
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.provision_amount",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "number",
      "text": {
        "en": "How much, in rupees?",
        "ml": "എത്ര രൂപ?"
      },
      "next": "guardianship.provision_source"
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.provision_source",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "single",
      "text": {
        "en": "From where?",
        "ml": "എവിടെ നിന്ന്?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "bank",
          "label": {
            "en": "My bank balances",
            "ml": "എന്റെ ബാങ്ക് ബാലൻസിൽ നിന്ന്"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "asset_sale",
          "label": {
            "en": "Sale of an asset",
            "ml": "ഒരു ആസ്തി വിറ്റ്"
          },
          "next": "guardianship.provision_source_desc"
        },
        {
          "id": "executor",
          "label": {
            "en": "Executor decides",
            "ml": "എക്സിക്യൂട്ടർ തീരുമാനിക്കട്ടെ"
          }
        }
      ],
      "nextRules": "[{\"when\":{\"eq\":[\"guardianship.gate\",\"both\"]},\"goto\":\"guardianship.dependents.item.person\"}]",
      "next": "debts.gate"
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.provision_source_desc",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "text",
      "text": {
        "en": "Which asset?",
        "ml": "ഏത് ആസ്തി?"
      },
      "nextRules": "[{\"when\":{\"eq\":[\"guardianship.gate\",\"both\"]},\"goto\":\"guardianship.dependents.item.person\"}]",
      "next": "debts.gate"
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.dependents.item.person",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "person",
      "text": {
        "en": "Who depends on you?",
        "ml": "നിങ്ങളെ ആരാണ് ആശ്രയിക്കുന്നത്?"
      },
      "next": "guardianship.dependents.item.carer"
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.dependents.item.carer",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "person",
      "text": {
        "en": "Who should look after them?",
        "ml": "അവരെ ആര് പരിപാലിക്കണം?"
      },
      "next": "guardianship.dependents.item.alt_carer"
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.dependents.item.alt_carer",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "person",
      "text": {
        "en": "And if that person can't?",
        "ml": "ആ വ്യക്തിക്ക് കഴിയില്ലെങ്കിലോ?"
      },
      "next": "guardianship.dependents.item.provision"
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.dependents.item.provision",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "single",
      "text": {
        "en": "Set aside money for their care?",
        "ml": "അവരുടെ സംരക്ഷണത്തിനായി പണം മാറ്റിവെക്കണോ?"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "yes",
          "label": {
            "en": "Yes",
            "ml": "അതെ"
          },
          "next": "guardianship.dependents.item.provision_amount"
        },
        {
          "id": "no",
          "label": {
            "en": "No",
            "ml": "ഇല്ല"
          }
        }
      ],
      "next": "guardianship.dependents.item.instructions"
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.dependents.item.provision_amount",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "number",
      "text": {
        "en": "How much, in rupees?",
        "ml": "എത്ര രൂപ?"
      },
      "next": "guardianship.dependents.item.instructions"
    },
    {
      "id": "guardianship.dependents.item.instructions",
      "section": "guardianship",
      "type": "longtext",
      "text": {
        "en": "Any care instructions?",
        "ml": "എന്തെങ്കിലും പരിചരണ നിർദ്ദേശങ്ങൾ?"
      },
      "optional": true,
      "next": "__ITEM_END__"
    }
  ]
}
